    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        149,
        1327,
        1263,
        1464
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, the City, at the 1971 Session of the State Legislature, sponsored the enactment of Laws of 1971, Ch. 615 which authorizes the New York City Board of Education, with the approval of the Mayor, to continue such increased-take-home-pay-plan during the City's 1971-1972 fiscal year; and",
